<title>USA: IMM currencies end down after widening losses late.</title>
<headline>IMM currencies end down after widening losses late.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 25 - IMM currency futures ended lower after widening losses late in the session. June yen set daily lows in the last 20 minutes of trade on Clinton-Hashimoto comments. Rubin's comments pulled June marks to $0.5803, below contract low settlement, and pressed June Swiss francs to a weekly low.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750/))</p>
